# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# What ships here: the catalogue, plus the Kenney art that is
# actually usable in a 2D browser game (CC0, redistributable).
#
# What does NOT ship: 3D model kits, and anything from LimeZu.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Kenney sections deliberately not pushed ──
# 3D assets: 606 MB of FBX/OBJ/GLB. Unusable in a canvas game and
# two-thirds of the bundle's weight. Catalogued, not committed.
kenney/3D assets/
# Archive: superseded packs, mostly still zipped.
kenney/Archive/
# Early access: unfinished, churns.
kenney/Early access/

# ── LimeZu "Modern Interiors" — NEVER COMMIT ──
# Paid asset. Its licence: "YOU CAN'T: Resell or distribute the
# asset to others". Metadata is catalogued; the art must never be
# published here, from any machine, in any branch.
modern-interiors/
limezu/
**/moderninteriors-win/
**/Modern_Interiors_RPG_Maker_Version/
**/Modern_Interiors_Free_v2.2/

# ── Original download archives (~800 MB of installers) ──
_source-zips/

# ── Redundant bundles/installers wherever they appear ──
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.exe
*.AppImage
*.unitypackage

# ── OS / editor metadata ──
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# ── Claude session state ──
.claude/
scratchpad/
*.tmp
*.log

# Kenney's own bundle index — it links the full 1 GB bundle including the
# 3D sections we don't publish, so it renders half-broken here. We ship
# catalog/index.html instead.
kenney/Overview.html
kenney/Readme.html

# Windows internet shortcuts from the bundle
*.url
